han the panels, about 5.5 m by 4.4 m and laid exactly on the voxels so it shows on all four faces (the first model's grid lines were the same colour as the panels and could not be seen); the Indiana limestone podium and stair made pale buff; the streets north and south of the block, from the ground file, with street trees. The panel grid is coarser than the real one."}